      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that i should talk to a doctor but i can't really get an appointment until next week and the pain is unbearable right now. i just wanted to know if there's any major reason why tramadol and sertraline wouldn't mix well? like is there a known interaction i should be worried about or is it mostly just a precaution?",
